<section class="whitepapers-page">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="whitepapers-header">
      <h1>Whitepaper</h1>
      <p>Insights and thought leadership on AI-native product strategy, operating model transformation, and value creation for PE-backed SaaS.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="whitepaper-card" id="wp1">
      <div class="whitepaper-content">
        <h2>AI-Native Product Leadership: Turning AI Ambition into Measurable Value</h2>
        <p>Most PE-backed SaaS companies have announced an AI strategy — but few have reshaped their product operating model to deliver on it. This whitepaper explores how fractional product leadership helps investors and operators move beyond feature-level AI integration to build AI-native strategies that drive measurable growth, efficiency, and valuation impact. It covers the key inflection points where operating models break down, how to realign product strategy around outcome-led priorities, and what it takes to turn AI ambition into a disciplined, ROI-driven product capability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="whitepaper-action">
        <button class="btn wp-toggle" data-target="wp1">Download PDF &darr;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="wp-form-wrap">
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xcontact" method="POST" class="wp-form">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Whitepaper Download: AI-Native Product Leadership">
          <label class="wp-label">Name <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required></label>
          <label class="wp-label">Job Title <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="jobtitle" placeholder="Job Title" required></label>
          <label class="wp-label">Company <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="company" placeholder="Company" required></label>
          <label class="wp-label">Email <span class="required">*</span><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required></label>
          <div class="wp-form-footer">
            <a href="/assets/downloads/ai-native-product-leadership.pdf" class="btn" download onclick="this.closest('form').submit()">Free Download &darr;</a>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script>
document.querySelectorAll('.wp-toggle').forEach(function(btn){
  btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var card = document.getElementById(this.dataset.target);
    card.classList.toggle('expanded');
    this.style.display = card.classList.contains('expanded') ? 'none' : '';
  });
});
// Email validation
document.querySelectorAll('.wp-form').forEach(function(form){
  form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
    var email = form.querySelector('input[name="email"]');
    var re = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]{2,}$/;
    if (!re.test(email.value)) {
      e.preventDefault();
      email.setCustomValidity('Please enter a valid email address');
      email.reportValidity();
    } else {
      email.setCustomValidity('');
    }
  });
});
</script>
